      "discuss": true,
      "discuss_reason": "Carries local-only dependencies not present upstream (currently num2words>=0.5.14). The Stage 1 execute_sync checkout overwrites pyproject.toml with the upstream version; without a modified_upstream_files exclusion the local-only deps are silently dropped (regressed in the 2026-06-01 sync). Must be restored and merged manually so local-only deps survive every sync."
    }
